st/steam_community_announcements/1847286114041998","verified_at":"2026-10-25T17:34:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5130980-1846651706686849","game_id":"steam-5130980","kind":"announcement","title":"Book Stacking Competition","summary":"The First Book Stacking CompetitionWe are only a day from Steam Next Fest, and I wanted to celebrate it by doing a book stacking contest! How it WorksYour goal is to simply create a shape, drawing or pattern by stacking the books in the demo. It could be anything such as a face, an animal, a shape of a house, a tile pattern, or simply sorting the stacks by pattern, etc. Here's an example below where I attempted created a purple cat face! How to SubmitSimply take a screenshot of your creation and","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T12:20:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706686849","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:08:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5130980-1846018067940075","game_id":"steam-5130980","kind":"announcement","title":"One Week Until Next Fest","summary":"Hello everyone, I'm happy to announce that the game will participate in the upcoming October Steam Next Fest! it's only a week from now and wanted to do a quick update on things.Reworked Steam page: First, the Steam page has been totally reworked with new trailer, screenshots, descriptions and capsule art. Now you can have a better glimpse of what the full game will bring. Since the full game will feature a variety of themes, and also support custom workshop, it will no longer be about archaic b","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T05:53:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067940075","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:08:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5130980-1843481262698874","game_id":"steam-5130980","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Release and Future Plans","summary":"Hello everyone, the demo for the game is now on Steam! It is almost identical with the itch io version with a little more polish and accessibility. It has touchscreen support which I haven't tested with a Steamdeck yet, but let me know if it works properly! About the demo: - Playtime greatly depends on your style of playing. The intended gameplay with upgrades will take between 1 to 2 hours. With no upgrades it can take about 8 hours. - Supports mouse, touchscreen, and partial keyboard input. Th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-13T05:37:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262698874","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:08:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5130980-1842212951308895","game_id":"steam-5130980","kind":"announcement","title":"1000 wishlists - thank you!","summary":"Thanks to everyone, the game has reached 1,000 wishlists in 4 days! Announcing a game is one of the most dreaded part of game development, You never really know, until you finally hit that “Publish” button, whether people will discover your game or if it will simply get buried under the millions of other games being released every day. Thanks again for wishlisting and leaving so many positive comments about the web demo on itch io. I know the current game scene is flooded with low-effort increme","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-31T02:41:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951308895","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:08:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5